00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:39,660
Yeah, that's a great analogy.

70
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:47,280
Right. You can walk out onto the bridge, note that the paint is pristine, the steel looks solid, the measurements are absolutely flawless.

71
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:51,100
But you are completely ignoring the unseen history of that bridge.

72
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:56,460
Exactly. Like, was it built using counterfeit steel that will just shear under winter temperatures?

73
00:05:56,600 --> 00:06:00,960
Right. Or were the safety inspectors actually on site during the pouring of the concrete?

